   ("s r" "Search repos" consult-gh-search-repos :if (lambda () (fboundp 'consult-gh-search-repos)))
   ("p l" "PR list" gh-emacs-pr-list)
   ("i l" "Issue list" gh-emacs-issue-list)])

(global-set-key (kbd "C-c g h") 'gh-emacs-transient)
```

